# Cloudflare redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Canonicalize the host to the apex https domain. Every <link rel="canonical"> on the
# site already points at https://equipmentfinancehub.com (no www); these 301s make the
# server agree, consolidating the www/http variants Search Console flagged as duplicates
# ("Page with redirect" / "Alternate page with proper canonical tag").
https://www.equipmentfinancehub.com/*  https://equipmentfinancehub.com/:splat  301
http://www.equipmentfinancehub.com/*   https://equipmentfinancehub.com/:splat  301
